#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events for the IBM Quantum System service"
msgstr "Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse für den IBM Quantum System-Dienst"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Activity tracking events for the IBM Quantum System service {#activity-"
"tracking-events-for-the-ibm-quantum-system-service}"
msgstr ""
"Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse für den IBM Quantum System-Dienst "
"{#activity-tracking-events-for-the-ibm-quantum-system-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as the IBM&reg; Quantum System service, "
"generate activity tracking events.\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Cloud&reg;-Dienste, wie der IBM&reg; Quantum System-Dienst, erzeugen "
"Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Activity tracking events report on activities that change the state of a "
"service in IBM Cloud. You can use the events to investigate abnormal "
"activity and critical actions and to comply with regulatory audit "
"requirements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse berichten über Aktivitäten, die den Zustand "
"eines Dienstes in IBM Cloud ändern. Du kannst die Ereignisse nutzen, um "
"ungewöhnliche Aktivitäten und kritische Aktionen zu untersuchen sowie "
"regulatorische Prüfanforderungen zu erfüllen.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, a platform service, to"
" route auditing events in your account to destinations of your choice by "
"configuring targets and routes that define where activity tracking events "
"are sent. For more information, see [About IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events"
" Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"
msgstr ""
"Du kannst IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, einen Plattformdienst, "
"verwenden, um Prüfereignisse in deinem Konto an Ziele deiner Wahl "
"weiterzuleiten, indem du Ziele und Routen konfigurierst, die festlegen, "
"wohin Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse gesendet werden. Weitere Informationen"
" findest du unter [About IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events "
"Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use IBM Cloud Logs to visualize and alert on events that are "
"generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event "
"Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Du kannst IBM Cloud Logs verwenden, um Ereignisse zu visualisieren und "
"Benachrichtigungen zu erhalten, die in deinem Konto erzeugt und von IBM "
"Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing an eine IBM Cloud Logs-Instanz "
"weitergeleitet werden.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Viewing activity tracking events for the IBM Quantum System service "
"{#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-the-ibm-quantum-system-service}"
msgstr ""
"Aktivitätsverfolgungsereignisse für den IBM Quantum System-Dienst anzeigen "
"{#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-the-ibm-quantum-system-service}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Launching IBM Cloud Logs from the Observability page {#launching-ibm-cloud-"
"logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr ""
"IBM Cloud Logs über die Observability-Seite starten {#launching-ibm-cloud-"
"logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For information on launching the IBM Cloud Logs UI, see the [Launching the "
"UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-"
"launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) in the IBM Cloud Logs documentation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Informationen zum Starten der IBM Cloud Logs-Benutzeroberfläche findest du "
"unter [Launching the UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-"
"logs-instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) in der IBM Cloud Logs-"
"Dokumentation.\n"

